OL,3,APolice searching for Noah Woods, 3, say
OL,4,Athey have found body of a child in lake
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice searching for three-year-old
OL,7,FNoah Woods say they have found the body
OL,8,Fof a child in a lake, known as Decoy
OL,9,FPond
OL,11,FFormal identification is yet to take
OL,12,Fplace, police say, but Noah's family
OL,13,Fhave been informed
OL,15,FNoah, who is partially deaf and
OL,16,Fnon-verbal, went missing from a
OL,17,Fplayground in Brantham, Suffolk on
OL,18,FTuesday afternoon
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
