OL,3,AUS accuses Russia of trying to kill
OL,4,AUkrainian allies overseas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Department of Justice (DoJ) has
OL,7,Faccused Russia of plotting to murder
OL,8,FUkrainian allies in the US and Europe.
OL,10,FIn a statement on Tuesday, the DoJ
OL,11,Fcharged five men allegedly connected to
OL,12,Fthe Russian Intelligence Services
OL,13,F(RIS). The men are accused of paying,
OL,14,For trying to pay, people in the US and
OL,15,Foverseas to target those "aligned, or
OL,16,Fperceived to be aligned, with Ukraine".
OL,18,F"It is our job to stop America's
OL,19,Fadversaries from unleashing violence
OL,20,Fand terror on American soil," Attorney
OL,21,FGeneral Todd Blanche. All those accused
OL,22,Fremain at large.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
